DTEND:20260604T150000
SUMMARY:Sections as a Computational Tool in Invariant Theory
DESCRIPTION:Invariants are essential for classifying mathematical objects up to a group of transformations. This talk will review several constructions of rational invariants where a section to the orbits is an essential ingredient for tractable computations. We will start with a general construction to obtain a generating set for the field of invariants. The output of the algorithm further provides rewrite r\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16378/
